\c 1
\p 
\v 1 \w The word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w that came unto Hosea| strong="H1954" \w*, \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Beeri| strong="H882" \w*, \w in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Uzziah| strong="H5818" \w*, \w Jotham| strong="H3147" \w*, \w Ahaz| strong="H271" \w*, and \w Hezekiah| strong="H3169" \w*, \w kings| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, \w and in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Jeroboam| strong="H3379" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Joash| strong="H3101" \w*, \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\p
\v 2 \w The beginning| strong="H8462" \w* [of the word]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} of the \sc Lord\sc* \w by Hosea| strong="H1954" \w*. And the \sc Lord\sc* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Hosea| strong="H1954" \w*, [Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [take]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w unto thee a wife| strong="H802" \w* \w of whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w* \w and children| strong="H3206" \w* \w of whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w*: \w for the land| strong="H776" \w* [hath committed great]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, departing \w from| strong="H310" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\v 3 [So he went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Gomer| strong="H1586" \w* \w the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Diblaim| strong="H1691" \w*; [which conceived]{strong=“H2029” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w him a son| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 4 And the \sc Lord\sc* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w his name| strong="H8034" \w* \w Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w*; \w for yet a little| strong="H4592" \w* while, [and I will avenge]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the blood| strong="H1818" \w* \w of Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w* \w upon the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Jehu| strong="H3058" \w*, [and will cause to cease]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the kingdom| strong="H4468" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 1:4 \ft avenge: Heb. visit \f* 
\v 5 \w And it shall come to pass at that day| strong="H3117" \w*, [that I will break]{strong=“H7665” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the bow| strong="H7198" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w in the valley| strong="H6010" \w* \w of Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w*. 
\p
\v 6 [And she conceived again]{strong=“H2029” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a daughter| strong="H1323" \w*. And God [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w her name| strong="H8034" \w* [Lo-ruhamah]{strong=“H3819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}: [for I will no more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [have mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w upon the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [but I will utterly]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [take them away]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 1:6 \ft Lo-ruhamah: that is, Not having obtained mercy \f* \f + \fr 1:6 \ft no…: Heb. not add any more to \f* \f + \fr 1:6 \ft but…: or, that I should altogether pardon them \f* 
\v 7 [But I will have mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w upon the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [and will save]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} them by the \sc Lord\sc* \w their God| strong="H430" \w*, [and will not save]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w them by bow| strong="H7198" \w*, \w nor by sword| strong="H2719" \w*, \w nor by battle| strong="H4421" \w*, \w by horses| strong="H5483" \w*, \w nor by horsemen| strong="H6571" \w*. 
\p
\v 8 [Now when she had weaned]{strong=“H1580” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [Lo-ruhamah]{strong=“H3819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}, [she conceived]{strong=“H2029” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a son| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 9 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} God, [Call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w his name| strong="H8034" \w* [Lo-ammi]{strong=“H3818”}: for ye are \w not my people| strong="H5971" \w*, and I will not be your God.\f + \fr 1:9 \ft Lo-ammi: that is, Not my people \f* 
\p
\v 10 \w Yet the number| strong="H4557" \w* \w of the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w shall be as the sand| strong="H2344" \w* \w of the sea| strong="H3220" \w*, [which cannot be measured]{strong=“H4058” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} [nor numbered]{strong=“H5608” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}; and it shall come to pass, that \w in the place| strong="H4725" \w* [where it was said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} unto them, Ye are \w not my people| strong="H5971" \w*, there [it shall be said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} unto them, Ye are \w the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of the living| strong="H2416" \w* \w God| strong="H410" \w*.\f + \fr 1:10 \ft in…: or, instead of that \f* 
\v 11 \w Then shall the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* \w and the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [be gathered]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w together| strong="H3162" \w*, [and appoint]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w themselves one| strong="H259" \w* \w head| strong="H7218" \w*, [and they shall come up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w*: \w for great| strong="H1419" \w* shall be \w the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w*.
\c 2
\p 
\v 1 [Say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w ye unto your brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w Ammi| strong="H5971" \w*; \w and to your sisters| strong="H269" \w*, [Ru-hamah]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}. \f + \fr 2:1 \ft Ammi: that is, My people \f* \f + \fr 2:1 \ft Ru-hamah: that is, Having obtained mercy \f* 
\v 2 [Plead]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w with your mother| strong="H517" \w*, [plead]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}: for she is \w not my wife| strong="H802" \w*, neither am \w I her husband| strong="H376" \w*: [let her therefore put away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w her whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w* \w out of her sight| strong="H6440" \w*, \w and her adulteries| strong="H5005" \w* \w from between her breasts| strong="H7699" \w*; 
\v 3 [Lest I strip]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w her naked| strong="H6174" \w*, [and set]{strong=“H3322” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her as in the day| strong="H3117" \w* [that she was born]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”}, [and make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her as a wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, [and set]{strong=“H7896” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her like a dry| strong="H6723" \w* \w land| strong="H776" \w*, [and slay]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her with thirst| strong="H6772" \w*. 
\v 4 [And I will not have mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w upon her children| strong="H1121" \w*; for they be \w the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w*. 
\v 5 \w For their mother| strong="H517" \w* [hath played the harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [she that conceived]{strong=“H2029” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [them hath done shamefully]{strong=“H3001” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}: [for she said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [I will go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w after| strong="H310" \w* [my lovers]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [that give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} me \w my bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w and my water| strong="H4325" \w*, \w my wool| strong="H6785" \w* \w and my flax| strong="H6593" \w*, \w mine oil| strong="H8081" \w* \w and my drink| strong="H8250" \w*.\f + \fr 2:5 \ft drink: Heb. drinks \f* 
\p
\v 6 [Therefore, behold, I will hedge]{strong=“H7753” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w up thy way| strong="H1870" \w* \w with thorns| strong="H5518" \w*, [and make]{strong=“H1443” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w a wall| strong="H1447" \w*, [that she shall not find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w her paths| strong="H5410" \w*.\f + \fr 2:6 \ft make…: Heb. wall a wall \f* 
\v 7 [And she shall follow]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [after her lovers]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [but she shall not overtake]{strong=“H5381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [them; and she shall seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [them, but shall not find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} them: [then shall she say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [I will go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to my first| strong="H7223" \w* \w husband| strong="H376" \w*; for then was it \w better| strong="H2896" \w* \w with me than now| strong="H6258" \w*. 
\v 8 [For she did not know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that I gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her corn| strong="H1715" \w*, \w and wine| strong="H8492" \w*, \w and oil| strong="H3323" \w*, [and multiplied]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her silver| strong="H3701" \w* \w and gold| strong="H2091" \w*, which [they prepared]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w for Baal| strong="H1168" \w*.\f + \fr 2:8 \ft wine: Heb. new wine \f* \f + \fr 2:8 \ft which…: or, wherewith they made Baal \f* 
\v 9 [Therefore will I return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and take away]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w my corn| strong="H1715" \w* \w in the time| strong="H6256" \w* [thereof, and my wine]{strong=“H8492”} \w in the season| strong="H4150" \w* [thereof, and will recover]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w my wool| strong="H6785" \w* \w and my flax| strong="H6593" \w* given [to cover]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w her nakedness| strong="H6172" \w*.\f + \fr 2:9 \ft recover: or, take away \f* 
\v 10 [And now will I discover]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w her lewdness| strong="H5040" \w* \w in the sight| strong="H5869" \w* [of her lovers]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, \w and none| strong="H376" \w* [shall deliver]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w her out of mine hand| strong="H3027" \w*.\f + \fr 2:10 \ft lewdness: Heb. folly, or, villany \f* 
\v 11 \w I will also cause all her mirth| strong="H4885" \w* [to cease]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, \w her feast days| strong="H2282" \w*, \w her new moons| strong="H2320" \w*, \w and her sabbaths| strong="H7676" \w*, \w and all her solemn feasts| strong="H4150" \w*. 
\v 12 [And I will destroy]{strong=“H8074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her vines| strong="H1612" \w* \w and her fig trees| strong="H8384" \w*, [whereof she hath said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, These are \w my rewards| strong="H866" \w* [that my lovers]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [have given]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [me: and I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w them a forest| strong="H3293" \w*, \w and the beasts| strong="H2416" \w* \w of the field| strong="H7704" \w* [shall eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them.\f + \fr 2:12 \ft destroy: Heb. make desolate \f* 
\v 13 [And I will visit]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w upon her the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Baalim| strong="H1168" \w*, [wherein she burned incense]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [to them, and she decked]{strong=“H5710” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w herself with her earrings| strong="H5141" \w* \w and her jewels| strong="H2484" \w*, [and she went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w after| strong="H310" \w* [her lovers]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [and forgat]{strong=“H7911” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [me, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\p
\v 14 [Therefore, behold, I will allure]{strong=“H6601” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [her, and bring]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her into the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, [and speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w comfortably| strong="H3820" \w* unto her.\f + \fr 2:14 \ft comfortably: or, friendly: Heb. to her heart \f* 
\v 15 [And I will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her her vineyards| strong="H3754" \w* [from thence, and the valley]{strong=“H6010”} \w of Achor| strong="H5911" \w* \w for a door| strong="H6607" \w* \w of hope| strong="H8615" \w*: [and she shall sing]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [there, as in the days]{strong=“H3117”} \w of her youth| strong="H5271" \w*, \w and as in the day| strong="H3117" \w* [when she came up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*. 
\v 16 \w And it shall be at that day| strong="H3117" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*, that [thou shalt call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w me Ishi| strong="H376" \w*; [and shalt call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w me no more Baali| strong="H1180" \w*.\f + \fr 2:16 \ft Ishi: that is, My husband \f* \f + \fr 2:16 \ft Baali: that is, My lord \f* 
\v 17 [For I will take away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the names| strong="H8034" \w* \w of Baalim| strong="H1168" \w* \w out of her mouth| strong="H6310" \w*, [and they shall no more be remembered]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w by their name| strong="H8034" \w*. 
\v 18 \w And in that day| strong="H3117" \w* [will I make]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w a covenant| strong="H1285" \w* \w for them with the beasts| strong="H2416" \w* \w of the field| strong="H7704" \w*, \w and with the fowls| strong="H5775" \w* \w of heaven| strong="H8064" \w*, and with \w the creeping things| strong="H7431" \w* \w of the ground| strong="H127" \w*: [and I will break]{strong=“H7665” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the bow| strong="H7198" \w* \w and the sword| strong="H2719" \w* \w and the battle| strong="H4421" \w* \w out of the earth| strong="H776" \w*, [and will make them to lie down]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w safely| strong="H983" \w*. 
\v 19 [And I will betroth]{strong=“H781” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w thee unto me for ever| strong="H5769" \w*; [yea, I will betroth]{strong=“H781” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w thee unto me in righteousness| strong="H6664" \w*, \w and in judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, \w and in lovingkindness| strong="H2617" \w*, \w and in mercies| strong="H7356" \w*. 
\v 20 [I will even betroth]{strong=“H781” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w thee unto me in faithfulness| strong="H530" \w*: [and thou shalt know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\v 21 \w And it shall come to pass in that day| strong="H3117" \w*, [I will hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*, [I will hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the heavens| strong="H8064" \w*, [and they shall hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the earth| strong="H776" \w*; 
\v 22 \w And the earth| strong="H776" \w* [shall hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the corn| strong="H1715" \w*, \w and the wine| strong="H8492" \w*, \w and the oil| strong="H3323" \w*; [and they shall hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w*. 
\v 23 [And I will sow]{strong=“H2232” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her unto me in the earth| strong="H776" \w*; [and I will have mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [upon her that had not obtained mercy]{strong=“H3818 H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}; [and I will say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} to them which were \w not my people| strong="H5971" \w*, Thou art \w my people| strong="H5971" \w*; [and they shall say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, Thou art \w my God| strong="H430" \w*.
\c 3
\p 
\v 1 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} the \sc Lord\sc* [unto me, Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [yet, love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w a woman| strong="H802" \w* [beloved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} of her \w friend| strong="H7453" \w*, [yet an adulteress]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, \w according to the love| strong="H160" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w toward the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [who look]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w to other| strong="H312" \w* \w gods| strong="H430" \w*, [and love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w flagons| strong="H809" \w* \w of wine| strong="H6025" \w*.\f + \fr 3:1 \ft of wine: Heb. of grapes \f* 
\v 2 [So I bought]{strong=“H3739” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [her to me for fifteen]{strong=“H2568 H6240”} pieces \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*, and for \w an homer| strong="H2563" \w* \w of barley| strong="H8184" \w*, \w and an half homer| strong="H3963" \w* \w of barley| strong="H8184" \w*:\f + \fr 3:2 \ft half…: Heb. lethech \f* 
\v 3 [And I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, Thou shalt abide]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for me many| strong="H7227" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w*; [thou shalt not play the harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and thou shalt not be]{strong=“H1961” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} for another \w man| strong="H376" \w*: so will I also be for thee. 
\v 4 \w For the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [shall abide]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w many| strong="H7227" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w* \w without a king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w and without a prince| strong="H8269" \w*, \w and without a sacrifice| strong="H2077" \w*, \w and without an image| strong="H4676" \w*, \w and without an ephod| strong="H646" \w*, and without \w teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*:\f + \fr 3:4 \ft image: Heb. a standing, or, statue, or, pillar \f* 
\v 5 \w Afterward| strong="H310" \w* \w shall the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w their God| strong="H430" \w*, \w and David| strong="H1732" \w* \w their king| strong="H4428" \w*; [and shall fear]{strong=“H6342” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w and his goodness| strong="H2898" \w* \w in the latter| strong="H319" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w*.
\c 4
\p 
\v 1 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w ye children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: for the \sc Lord\sc* \w hath a controversy| strong="H7379" \w* [with the inhabitants]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of the land| strong="H776" \w*, because there is \w no truth| strong="H571" \w*, \w nor mercy| strong="H2617" \w*, \w nor knowledge| strong="H1847" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w* \w in the land| strong="H776" \w*. 
\v 2 [By swearing]{strong=“H422” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and lying]{strong=“H3584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”}, [and killing]{strong=“H7523” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and stealing]{strong=“H1589” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and committing adultery]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [they break out]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and blood| strong="H1818" \w* [toucheth]{strong=“H5060” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w blood| strong="H1818" \w*.\f + \fr 4:2 \ft blood: Heb. bloods \f* 
\v 3 \w Therefore shall the land| strong="H776" \w* [mourn]{strong=“H56” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and every one that dwelleth]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [therein shall languish]{strong=“H535” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8797”}, \w with the beasts| strong="H2416" \w* \w of the field| strong="H7704" \w*, \w and with the fowls| strong="H5775" \w* \w of heaven| strong="H8064" \w*; [yea, the fishes]{strong=“H1709”} \w of the sea| strong="H3220" \w* [also shall be taken away]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. 
\v 4 \w Yet let no man| strong="H376" \w* [strive]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [nor reprove]{strong=“H3198” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w another| strong="H376" \w*: \w for thy people| strong="H5971" \w* are [as they that strive]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w with the priest| strong="H3548" \w*. 
\v 5 [Therefore shalt thou fall]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w*, \w and the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* [also shall fall]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with thee in the night| strong="H3915" \w*, [and I will destroy]{strong=“H1820” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thy mother| strong="H517" \w*.\f + \fr 4:5 \ft destroy: Heb. cut off \f* 
\p
\v 6 \w My people| strong="H5971" \w* [are destroyed]{strong=“H1820” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w for lack of knowledge| strong="H1847" \w*: [because thou hast rejected]{strong=“H3988” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w knowledge| strong="H1847" \w*, [I will also reject]{strong=“H3988” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thee, that thou shalt be no priest]{strong=“H3547” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [to me: seeing thou hast forgotten]{strong=“H7911” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the law| strong="H8451" \w* \w of thy God| strong="H430" \w*, [I will also forget]{strong=“H7911” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy children| strong="H1121" \w*.\f + \fr 4:6 \ft destroyed: Heb. cut off \f* 
\v 7 \w As they were increased| strong="H7230" \w*, [so they sinned]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} against me: therefore [will I change]{strong=“H4171” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w their glory| strong="H3519" \w* \w into shame| strong="H7036" \w*. 
\v 8 [They eat up]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the sin| strong="H2403" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*, [and they set]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their heart| strong="H5315" \w* \w on their iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*.\f + \fr 4:8 \ft set…: Heb. lift up their soul to \f* 
\v 9 [And there shall be, like people]{strong=“H5971”}, \w like priest| strong="H3548" \w*: [and I will punish]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w them for their ways| strong="H1870" \w*, [and reward]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w them their doings| strong="H4611" \w*.\f + \fr 4:9 \ft punish: Heb. visit upon \f* \f + \fr 4:9 \ft reward: Heb. cause to return \f* 
\v 10 [For they shall eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and not have enough]{strong=“H7646” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [they shall commit whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [and shall not increase]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [because they have left off]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to take heed]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} to the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\v 11 \w Whoredom| strong="H2184" \w* \w and wine| strong="H3196" \w* \w and new wine| strong="H8492" \w* [take away]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the heart| strong="H3820" \w*. 
\p
\v 12 \w My people| strong="H5971" \w* [ask]{strong=“H7592” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w counsel at their stocks| strong="H6086" \w*, \w and their staff| strong="H4731" \w* [declareth]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [unto them: for the spirit]{strong=“H7307”} \w of whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w* hath caused them [to err]{strong=“H8582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [and they have gone a whoring]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from under their God| strong="H430" \w*. 
\v 13 [They sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w upon the tops| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the mountains| strong="H2022" \w*, [and burn incense]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w upon the hills| strong="H1389" \w*, \w under oaks| strong="H437" \w* \w and poplars| strong="H3839" \w* \w and elms| strong="H424" \w*, \w because the shadow| strong="H6738" \w* thereof is \w good| strong="H2896" \w*: \w therefore your daughters| strong="H1323" \w* [shall commit whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and your spouses| strong="H3618" \w* [shall commit adultery]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}. 
\v 14 [I will not punish]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w your daughters| strong="H1323" \w* [when they commit whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w nor your spouses| strong="H3618" \w* [when they commit adultery]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}: [for themselves are separated]{strong=“H6504” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [with whores]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and they sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w with harlots| strong="H6948" \w*: \w therefore the people| strong="H5971" \w* that [doth not understand]{strong=“H995” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [shall fall]{strong=“H3832” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}.\f + \fr 4:14 \ft I will not: or, Shall I not \f* \f + \fr 4:14 \ft fall: or, be punished \f* 
\p
\v 15 [Though thou, Israel]{strong=“H3478”}, [play the harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, yet \w let not Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [offend]{strong=“H816” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [and come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not ye unto Gilgal| strong="H1537" \w*, [neither go ye up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to Beth-aven]{strong=“H1007”}, [nor swear]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, The \sc Lord\sc* \w liveth| strong="H2416" \w*. 
\v 16 \w For Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [slideth back]{strong=“H5637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [as a backsliding]{strong=“H5637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w heifer| strong="H6510" \w*: now the \sc Lord\sc* [will feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them as a lamb| strong="H3532" \w* \w in a large place| strong="H4800" \w*. 
\v 17 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* is [joined]{strong=“H2266” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w to idols| strong="H6091" \w*: [let him alone]{strong=“H3240” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}. 
\v 18 \w Their drink| strong="H5435" \w* [is sour]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [they have committed whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [continually]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}: \w her rulers| strong="H4043" \w* with \w shame| strong="H7036" \w* [do love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Give]{strong=“H3051” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} ye.\f + \fr 4:18 \ft sour: Heb. gone \f* \f + \fr 4:18 \ft rulers: Heb. shields \f* 
\v 19 \w The wind| strong="H7307" \w* [hath bound her up]{strong=“H6887” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in her wings| strong="H3671" \w*, [and they shall be ashamed]{strong=“H954” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w because of their sacrifices| strong="H2077" \w*.
\c 5
\p 
\v 1 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [ye this, O priests]{strong=“H3548”}; [and hearken]{strong=“H7181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, \w ye house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [and give ye ear]{strong=“H238” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, \w O house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of the king| strong="H4428" \w*; \w for judgment| strong="H4941" \w* is [toward you, because ye have been a snare]{strong=“H6341”} \w on Mizpah| strong="H4709" \w*, \w and a net| strong="H7568" \w* [spread]{strong=“H6566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w upon Tabor| strong="H8396" \w*. 
\v 2 \w And the revolters| strong="H7846" \w* [are profound]{strong=“H6009” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [to make slaughter]{strong=“H7819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, though I have been \w a rebuker| strong="H4148" \w* of them all.\f + \fr 5:2 \ft though: or, and \f* \f + \fr 5:2 \ft a rebuker: Heb. a correction \f* 
\v 3 [I know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w and Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [is not hid]{strong=“H3582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [from me: for now, O Ephraim]{strong=“H669”}, [thou committest whoredom]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, and \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [is defiled]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}. 
\v 4 [They will not frame]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their doings| strong="H4611" \w* [to turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w unto their God| strong="H430" \w*: \w for the spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w of whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w* is \w in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of them, and they have not known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*.\f + \fr 5:4 \ft They will…: or, Their doings will not suffer them \f* \f + \fr 5:4 \ft frame: Heb. give \f* 
\v 5 \w And the pride| strong="H1347" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [doth testify]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to his face| strong="H6440" \w*: \w therefore shall Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w and Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [fall]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in their iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*; \w Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [also shall fall]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} with them. 
\v 6 [They shall go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with their flocks| strong="H6629" \w* \w and with their herds| strong="H1241" \w* [to seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} the \sc Lord\sc*; [but they shall not find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him; [he hath withdrawn]{strong=“H2502” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} himself from them. 
\v 7 [They have dealt treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} against the \sc Lord\sc*: [for they have begotten]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [strange]{strong=“H2114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w children| strong="H1121" \w*: \w now shall a month| strong="H2320" \w* [devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them with their portions| strong="H2506" \w*. 
\p
\v 8 [Blow]{strong=“H8628” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w ye the cornet| strong="H7782" \w* \w in Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*, and \w the trumpet| strong="H2689" \w* \w in Ramah| strong="H7414" \w*: [cry aloud]{strong=“H7321” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} at [Beth-aven]{strong=“H1007”}, \w after| strong="H310" \w* [thee, O Benjamin]{strong=“H1144”}. 
\v 9 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w shall be desolate| strong="H8047" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of rebuke| strong="H8433" \w*: \w among the tribes| strong="H7626" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [have I made known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [that which shall surely be]{strong=“H539” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}. 
\v 10 \w The princes| strong="H8269" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [were like them that remove]{strong=“H5253” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w the bound| strong="H1366" \w*: therefore [I will pour out]{strong=“H8210” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my wrath| strong="H5678" \w* \w upon them like water| strong="H4325" \w*. 
\v 11 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* is [oppressed ]{strong=“H6231” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} and [broken]{strong=“H7533” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w in judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, [because he willingly]{strong=“H2974” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [walked]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w after| strong="H310" \w* \w the commandment| strong="H6673" \w*. 
\v 12 Therefore will I be \w unto Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w as a moth| strong="H6211" \w*, \w and to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* \w as rottenness| strong="H7538" \w*.\f + \fr 5:12 \ft rottenness: or, a worm \f* 
\v 13 \w When Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his sickness| strong="H2483" \w*, \w and Judah| strong="H3063" \w* saw \w his wound| strong="H4205" \w*, [then went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w to the Assyrian| strong="H804" \w*, [and sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to king| strong="H4428" \w* [Jareb]{strong=“H7378 H3377” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677”}: [yet could]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [he not heal]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [you, nor cure]{strong=“H1455” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w you of your wound| strong="H4205" \w*.\f + \fr 5:13 \ft king Jareb: or, the king of Jareb: or, the king that should plead \f* 
\v 14 For I will be \w unto Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w as a lion| strong="H7826" \w*, \w and as a young lion| strong="H3715" \w* \w to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*: I, even [I, will tear]{strong=“H2963” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and go away]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [I will take away]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and none shall rescue]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} him. 
\p
\v 15 [I will go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} and [return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to my place| strong="H4725" \w*, [till they acknowledge their offence]{strong=“H816” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w my face| strong="H6440" \w*: \w in their affliction| strong="H6862" \w* [they will seek me early]{strong=“H7836” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}.\f + \fr 5:15 \ft acknowledge…: Heb. be guilty \f*
\c 6
\p 
\v 1 [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and let us return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*: [for he hath torn]{strong=“H2963” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and he will heal]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [us; he hath smitten]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and he will bind us up]{strong=“H2280” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 2 \w After two days| strong="H3117" \w* [will he revive]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [us: in the third]{strong=“H7992”} \w day| strong="H3117" \w* [he will raise us up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and we shall live]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in his sight| strong="H6440" \w*. 
\v 3 [Then shall we know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, if [we follow]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [on to know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} the \sc Lord\sc*: \w his going forth| strong="H4161" \w* [is prepared]{strong=“H3559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w as the morning| strong="H7837" \w*; [and he shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto us as the rain| strong="H1653" \w*, \w as the latter| strong="H4456" \w* and [former rain]{strong=“H3384” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unto the earth| strong="H776" \w*. 
\p
\v 4 \w O Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [what shall I do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto thee? O Judah]{strong=“H3063”}, [what shall I do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto thee? for your goodness]{strong=“H2617”} is \w as a morning| strong="H1242" \w* \w cloud| strong="H6051" \w*, [and as the early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w dew| strong="H2919" \w* [it goeth away]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 6:4 \ft goodness: or, mercy, or, kindness \f* 
\v 5 [Therefore have I hewed]{strong=“H2672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them \w by the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*; [I have slain]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w them by the words| strong="H561" \w* \w of my mouth| strong="H6310" \w*: \w and thy judgments| strong="H4941" \w* are as \w the light| strong="H216" \w* that [goeth forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 6:5 \ft and…: or, that thy judgments might be, etc \f* 
\v 6 [For I desired]{strong=“H2654” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w mercy| strong="H2617" \w*, \w and not sacrifice| strong="H2077" \w*; \w and the knowledge| strong="H1847" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w* \w more than burnt offerings| strong="H5930" \w*. 
\v 7 \w But they like men| strong="H120" \w* [have transgressed]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the covenant| strong="H1285" \w*: [there have they dealt treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} against me.\f + \fr 6:7 \ft men: or, Adam \f* 
\v 8 \w Gilead| strong="H1568" \w* is \w a city| strong="H7151" \w* [of them that work]{strong=“H6466” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w iniquity| strong="H205" \w*, and is \w polluted| strong="H6121" \w* \w with blood| strong="H1818" \w*.\f + \fr 6:8 \ft polluted: or, cunning for \f* 
\v 9 \w And as troops| strong="H1416" \w* [of robbers wait]{strong=“H2442” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w for a man| strong="H376" \w*, so \w the company| strong="H2267" \w* \w of priests| strong="H3548" \w* [murder]{strong=“H7523” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w in the way| strong="H1870" \w* [by consent]{strong=“H7927 H7926” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677”}: [for they commit]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w lewdness| strong="H2154" \w*.\f + \fr 6:9 \ft by…: Heb. with one shoulder, or, to Shechem \f* \f + \fr 6:9 \ft lewdness: or, enormity \f* 
\v 10 [I have seen]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w an horrible thing| strong="H8186" \w* \w in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: there is \w the whoredom| strong="H2184" \w* \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [is defiled]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}. 
\v 11 [Also, O Judah]{strong=“H3063”}, [he hath set]{strong=“H7896” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w an harvest| strong="H7105" \w* [for thee, when I returned]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the captivity| strong="H7622" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*.
\c 7
\p 
\v 1 [When I would have healed]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, \w then the iniquity| strong="H5771" \w* \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [was discovered]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, \w and the wickedness| strong="H7451" \w* \w of Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*: [for they commit]{strong=“H6466” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w falsehood| strong="H8267" \w*; \w and the thief| strong="H1590" \w* [cometh in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, and \w the troop| strong="H1416" \w* [of robbers spoileth]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w without| strong="H2351" \w*.\f + \fr 7:1 \ft wickedness: Heb. evils \f* \f + \fr 7:1 \ft spoileth: Heb. strippeth \f* 
\v 2 [And they consider]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not in their hearts| strong="H3824" \w* that [I remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w all their wickedness| strong="H7451" \w*: \w now their own doings| strong="H4611" \w* [have beset them about]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w they are before my face| strong="H6440" \w*.\f + \fr 7:2 \ft consider…: Heb. say not to \f* 
\v 3 \w They make the king| strong="H4428" \w* [glad]{strong=“H8055” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w with their wickedness| strong="H7451" \w*, \w and the princes| strong="H8269" \w* \w with their lies| strong="H3585" \w*. 
\v 4 They are [all adulterers]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, \w as an oven| strong="H8574" \w* [heated]{strong=“H1197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [by the baker]{strong=“H644” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, who [ceaseth]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [from raising]{strong=“H5782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [after he hath kneaded]{strong=“H3888” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the dough| strong="H1217" \w*, [until it be leavened]{strong=“H2556” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}.\f + \fr 7:4 \ft who…: or, the raiser will cease \f* \f + \fr 7:4 \ft raising: or, waking \f* 
\v 5 \w In the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of our king| strong="H4428" \w* \w the princes| strong="H8269" \w* have made him [sick]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w with bottles| strong="H2534" \w* \w of wine| strong="H3196" \w*; [he stretched out]{strong=“H4900” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w his hand| strong="H3027" \w* [with scorners]{strong=“H3945” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 7:5 \ft bottles…: or, heat through wine \f* 
\v 6 [For they have made ready]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w their heart| strong="H3820" \w* \w like an oven| strong="H8574" \w*, [whiles they lie in wait]{strong=“H693” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: [their baker]{strong=“H644” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w sleepeth| strong="H3463" \w* \w all the night| strong="H3915" \w*; \w in the morning| strong="H1242" \w* [it burneth]{strong=“H1197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w as a flaming| strong="H3852" \w* \w fire| strong="H784" \w*.\f + \fr 7:6 \ft made…: or, applied \f* 
\v 7 [They are all hot]{strong=“H2552” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w as an oven| strong="H8574" \w*, [and have devoured]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [their judges]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; \w all their kings| strong="H4428" \w* [are fallen]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: there is [none among them that calleth]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} unto me. 
\p
\v 8 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [he hath mixed]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8704”} \w himself among the people| strong="H5971" \w*; \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w is a cake| strong="H5692" \w* [not turned]{strong=“H2015” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}. 
\v 9 [Strangers]{strong=“H2114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} [have devoured]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w his strength| strong="H3581" \w*, [and he knoweth]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it [not: yea, gray hairs]{strong=“H7872”} [are here and there]{strong=“H2236” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [upon him, yet he knoweth]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} not.\f + \fr 7:9 \ft here…: Heb. sprinkled \f* 
\v 10 \w And the pride| strong="H1347" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [testifieth]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to his face| strong="H6440" \w*: [and they do not return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} to the \sc Lord\sc* \w their God| strong="H430" \w*, [nor seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} him for all this. 
\p
\v 11 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [also is like a silly]{strong=“H6601” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w dove| strong="H3123" \w* \w without heart| strong="H3820" \w*: [they call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [they go]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to Assyria| strong="H804" \w*. 
\v 12 [When they shall go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I will spread]{strong=“H6566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my net| strong="H7568" \w* [upon them; I will bring them down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w as the fowls| strong="H5775" \w* \w of the heaven| strong="H8064" \w*; [I will chastise]{strong=“H3256” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [them, as their congregation]{strong=“H5712”} \w hath heard| strong="H8088" \w*. 
\v 13 \w Woe| strong="H188" \w* [unto them! for they have fled]{strong=“H5074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [from me: destruction]{strong=“H7701”} [unto them! because they have transgressed]{strong=“H6586” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [against me: though I have redeemed]{strong=“H6299” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them, yet they have spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w lies| strong="H3577" \w* against me.\f + \fr 7:13 \ft destruction: Heb. spoil \f* 
\v 14 [And they have not cried]{strong=“H2199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto me with their heart| strong="H3820" \w*, [when they howled]{strong=“H3213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w upon their beds| strong="H4904" \w*: [they assemble]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8709”} \w themselves for corn| strong="H1715" \w* \w and wine| strong="H8492" \w*, and [they rebel]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} against me. 
\v 15 [Though I have bound]{strong=“H3256” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} and [strengthened]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w their arms| strong="H2220" \w*, [yet do they imagine]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w mischief| strong="H7451" \w* against me.\f + \fr 7:15 \ft have…: or, chastened \f* 
\v 16 [They return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, but \w not to the most High| strong="H5920" \w*: \w they are like a deceitful| strong="H7423" \w* \w bow| strong="H7198" \w*: \w their princes| strong="H8269" \w* [shall fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w by the sword| strong="H2719" \w* \w for the rage| strong="H2195" \w* \w of their tongue| strong="H3956" \w*: \w this| strong="H2097" \w* shall be \w their derision| strong="H3933" \w* \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*.
\c 8
\p 
\v 1 Set \w the trumpet| strong="H7782" \w* \w to thy mouth| strong="H2441" \w*. He shall come \w as an eagle| strong="H5404" \w* \w against the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, [because they have transgressed]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w my covenant| strong="H1285" \w*, [and trespassed]{strong=“H6586” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against my law| strong="H8451" \w*.\f + \fr 8:1 \ft thy: Heb. the roof of thy \f* 
\v 2 \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [shall cry]{strong=“H2199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto me, My God]{strong=“H430”}, [we know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thee. 
\v 3 \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [hath cast off]{strong=“H2186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the thing that is \w good| strong="H2896" \w*: [the enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall pursue]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him. 
\v 4 [They have set up kings]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [but not by me: they have made princes]{strong=“H7786” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [and I knew]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it [not: of their silver]{strong=“H3701”} \w and their gold| strong="H2091" \w* [have they made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w them idols| strong="H6091" \w*, [that they may be cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. 
\p
\v 5 \w Thy calf| strong="H5695" \w*, \w O Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*, [hath cast]{strong=“H2186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thee [off; mine anger]{strong=“H639”} [is kindled]{strong=“H2734” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} against them: how long will it be \w ere| strong="H3808" \w* [they attain]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to innocency| strong="H5356" \w*? 
\v 6 \w For from Israel| strong="H3478" \w* was [it also: the workman]{strong=“H2796”} [made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it; therefore it is \w not God| strong="H430" \w*: \w but the calf| strong="H5695" \w* \w of Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* \w shall be broken in pieces| strong="H7616" \w*. 
\v 7 [For they have sown]{strong=“H2232” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the wind| strong="H7307" \w*, [and they shall reap]{strong=“H7114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the whirlwind| strong="H5492" \w*: \w it hath no stalk| strong="H7054" \w*: \w the bud| strong="H6780" \w* [shall yield]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w no meal| strong="H7058" \w*: \w if| strong="H194" \w* [so be it yield]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [the strangers]{strong=“H2114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} [shall swallow it up]{strong=“H1104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 8:7 \ft stalk: or, standing corn \f* 
\p
\v 8 \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [is swallowed up]{strong=“H1104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}: \w now shall they be among the Gentiles| strong="H1471" \w* \w as a vessel| strong="H3627" \w* wherein is \w no pleasure| strong="H2656" \w*. 
\v 9 [For they are gone up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to Assyria| strong="H804" \w*, \w a wild ass| strong="H6501" \w* [alone]{strong=“H909” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [by himself: Ephraim]{strong=“H669”} [hath hired]{strong=“H8566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w lovers| strong="H158" \w*.\f + \fr 8:9 \ft lovers: Heb. loves \f* 
\v 10 [Yea, though they have hired]{strong=“H8566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w among the nations| strong="H1471" \w*, [now will I gather]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [them, and they shall sorrow]{strong=“H2490” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w a little| strong="H4592" \w* \w for the burden| strong="H4853" \w* \w of the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of princes| strong="H8269" \w*.\f + \fr 8:10 \ft sorrow: or, begin \f* \f + \fr 8:10 \ft a…: or, in a little while \f* 
\v 11 \w Because Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [hath made many]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w altars| strong="H4196" \w* [to sin]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w altars| strong="H4196" \w* [shall be unto him to sin]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\v 12 [I have written]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to him the great things]{strong=“H7239 H7230” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”} \w of my law| strong="H8451" \w*, but [they were counted]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [as a strange thing]{strong=“H2114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”}. 
\v 13 [They sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w flesh| strong="H1320" \w* for \w the sacrifices| strong="H2077" \w* \w of mine offerings| strong="H1890" \w*, [and eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it; but the \sc Lord\sc* [accepteth]{strong=“H7521” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them not; now will he remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, [and visit]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their sins| strong="H2403" \w*: [they shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*.\f + \fr 8:13 \ft They sacrifice…: or, In the sacrifices of mine offerings they, etc \f* 
\v 14 \w For Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [hath forgotten]{strong=“H7911” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [his Maker]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and buildeth]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w temples| strong="H1964" \w*; \w and Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [hath multiplied]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [fenced]{strong=“H1219” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w cities| strong="H5892" \w*: [but I will send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w a fire| strong="H784" \w* \w upon his cities| strong="H5892" \w*, [and it shall devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the palaces| strong="H759" \w* thereof.
\c 9
\p 
\v 1 [Rejoice]{strong=“H8055” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [not, O Israel]{strong=“H3478”}, \w for joy| strong="H1524" \w*, as other \w people| strong="H5971" \w*: [for thou hast gone a whoring]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w from thy God| strong="H430" \w*, [thou hast loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w a reward| strong="H868" \w* [upon every cornfloor]{strong=“H1715 H1637”}.\f + \fr 9:1 \ft upon: or, in, etc \f* 
\v 2 \w The floor| strong="H1637" \w* \w and the winepress| strong="H3342" \w* [shall not feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them, and the new wine]{strong=“H8492”} [shall fail]{strong=“H3584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} in her.\f + \fr 9:2 \ft winepress: or, winefat \f* 
\v 3 [They shall not dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} in the \sc Lord\sc*’S \w land| strong="H776" \w*; \w but Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and they shall eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unclean| strong="H2931" \w* things \w in Assyria| strong="H804" \w*. 
\v 4 [They shall not offer]{strong=“H5258” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w wine| strong="H3196" \w* offerings to the \sc Lord\sc*, [neither shall they be pleasing]{strong=“H6149” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him: their sacrifices]{strong=“H2077”} shall be \w unto them as the bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w of mourners| strong="H205" \w*; [all that eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [thereof shall be polluted]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”}: \w for their bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w for their soul| strong="H5315" \w* [shall not come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\v 5 [What will ye do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the solemn| strong="H4150" \w* \w day| strong="H3117" \w*, \w and in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of the feast| strong="H2282" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*? 
\v 6 [For, lo, they are gone]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w because of destruction| strong="H7701" \w*: \w Egypt| strong="H4714" \w* [shall gather them up]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}, \w Memphis| strong="H4644" \w* [shall bury]{strong=“H6912” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [them: the pleasant]{strong=“H4261”} places \w for their silver| strong="H3701" \w*, \w nettles| strong="H7057" \w* [shall possess]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them: thorns]{strong=“H2336”} shall be \w in their tabernacles| strong="H168" \w*.\f + \fr 9:6 \ft destruction: Heb. spoil \f* \f + \fr 9:6 \ft the…: or, their silver shall be desired, the nettle, etc.: Heb. the desire \f* 
\p
\v 7 \w The days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of visitation| strong="H6486" \w* [are come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of recompence| strong="H7966" \w* [are come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [shall know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it: \w the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* is \w a fool| strong="H191" \w*, \w the spiritual| strong="H7307" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w* is [mad]{strong=“H7696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}, \w for the multitude| strong="H7230" \w* \w of thine iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, \w and the great| strong="H7227" \w* \w hatred| strong="H4895" \w*.\f + \fr 9:7 \ft spiritual…: Heb. man of the spirit \f* 
\v 8 [The watchman]{strong=“H6822” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* was \w with my God| strong="H430" \w*: but \w the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* is \w a snare| strong="H6341" \w* \w of a fowler| strong="H3352" \w* \w in all his ways| strong="H1870" \w*, and \w hatred| strong="H4895" \w* \w in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of his God| strong="H430" \w*.\f + \fr 9:8 \ft in the: or, against the \f* 
\v 9 [They have deeply]{strong=“H6009” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [corrupted]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} themselves, \w as in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*: therefore [he will remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, [he will visit]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their sins| strong="H2403" \w*. 
\v 10 [I found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w like grapes| strong="H6025" \w* \w in the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*; [I saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w your fathers| strong="H1" \w* \w as the firstripe| strong="H1063" \w* \w in the fig tree| strong="H8384" \w* \w at her first time| strong="H7225" \w*: but [they went]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to Baal-peor]{strong=“H1187”}, [and separated]{strong=“H5144” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} themselves unto that \w shame| strong="H1322" \w*; and their \w abominations| strong="H8251" \w* [were according as they loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\p
\v 11 As for \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w their glory| strong="H3519" \w* [shall fly away]{strong=“H5774” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8709”} \w like a bird| strong="H5775" \w*, [from the birth]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w and from the womb| strong="H990" \w*, \w and from the conception| strong="H2032" \w*. 
\v 12 [Though they bring up]{strong=“H1431” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w their children| strong="H1121" \w*, [yet will I bereave]{strong=“H7921” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} them, that there shall not be \w a man| strong="H120" \w* left: [yea, woe]{strong=“H188”} [also to them when I depart]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} from them! 
\v 13 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [as I saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Tyrus| strong="H6865" \w*, is [planted]{strong=“H8362” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w in a pleasant place| strong="H5116" \w*: \w but Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [shall bring forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w his children| strong="H1121" \w* [to the murderer]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 14 [Give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} them, O \sc Lord\sc*: [what wilt thou give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? [give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [them a miscarrying]{strong=“H7921” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w womb| strong="H7358" \w* [and dry]{strong=“H6784” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w breasts| strong="H7699" \w*.\f + \fr 9:14 \ft miscarrying: Heb. that casteth the fruit \f* 
\v 15 \w All their wickedness| strong="H7451" \w* is \w in Gilgal| strong="H1537" \w*: [for there I hated]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them: for the wickedness]{strong=“H7455”} \w of their doings| strong="H4611" \w* [I will drive them out]{strong=“H1644” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w of mine house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w I will love| strong="H160" \w* [them no more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}: \w all their princes| strong="H8269" \w* are [revolters]{strong=“H5637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 16 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [is smitten]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”}, \w their root| strong="H8328" \w* [is dried up]{strong=“H3001” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [they shall bear]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w no fruit| strong="H6529" \w*: [yea, though they bring forth]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [yet will I slay]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} even \w the beloved| strong="H4261" \w* fruit \w of their womb| strong="H990" \w*.\f + \fr 9:16 \ft the…: Heb. the desires \f* 
\v 17 \w My God| strong="H430" \w* [will cast them away]{strong=“H3988” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [because they did not hearken]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [unto him: and they shall be wanderers]{strong=“H5074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w among the nations| strong="H1471" \w*.
\c 10
\p 
\v 1 \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* is [an empty]{strong=“H1238” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w vine| strong="H1612" \w*, [he bringeth forth]{strong=“H7737” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w fruit| strong="H6529" \w* [unto himself: according to the multitude]{strong=“H7230”} \w of his fruit| strong="H6529" \w* [he hath increased]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the altars| strong="H4196" \w*; \w according to the goodness| strong="H2896" \w* \w of his land| strong="H776" \w* [they have made goodly]{strong=“H2895” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w images| strong="H4676" \w*.\f + \fr 10:1 \ft an…: or, a vine emptying the fruit which it giveth \f* \f + \fr 10:1 \ft images: Heb. statues, or, standing images \f* 
\v 2 \w Their heart| strong="H3820" \w* [is divided]{strong=“H2505” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; [now shall they be found faulty]{strong=“H816” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [he shall break down]{strong=“H6202” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their altars| strong="H4196" \w*, [he shall spoil]{strong=“H7703” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8779”} \w their images| strong="H4676" \w*.\f + \fr 10:2 \ft Their heart…: or, He hath divided their heart \f* \f + \fr 10:2 \ft break…: Heb. behead \f* \f + \fr 10:2 \ft images: Heb. statues, or, standing images \f* 
\v 3 [For now they shall say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w We have no king| strong="H4428" \w*, [because we feared]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} not the \sc Lord\sc*; \w what then should a king| strong="H4428" \w* [do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} to us? 
\v 4 [They have spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w words| strong="H1697" \w*, [swearing]{strong=“H422” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w falsely| strong="H7723" \w* [in making]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w a covenant| strong="H1285" \w*: \w thus judgment| strong="H4941" \w* [springeth up]{strong=“H6524” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w as hemlock| strong="H7219" \w* \w in the furrows| strong="H8525" \w* \w of the field| strong="H7704" \w*. 
\v 5 \w The inhabitants| strong="H7934" \w* \w of Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* [shall fear]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w because of the calves| strong="H5697" \w* [of Beth-aven]{strong=“H1007”}: \w for the people| strong="H5971" \w* [thereof shall mourn]{strong=“H56” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [over it, and the priests]{strong=“H3649”} thereof that [rejoiced]{strong=“H1523” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [on it, for the glory]{strong=“H3519”} [thereof, because it is departed]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} from it.\f + \fr 10:5 \ft the priests…: or, Chemarim \f* 
\v 6 [It shall be also carried]{strong=“H2986” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”} \w unto Assyria| strong="H804" \w* for \w a present| strong="H4503" \w* \w to king| strong="H4428" \w* \w Jareb| strong="H3377" \w*: \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [shall receive]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w shame| strong="H1317" \w*, \w and Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [shall be ashamed]{strong=“H954” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of his own counsel| strong="H6098" \w*. 
\v 7 As for \w Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*, \w her king| strong="H4428" \w* [is cut off]{strong=“H1820” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w as the foam| strong="H7110" \w* \w upon| strong="H6440" \w* \w the water| strong="H4325" \w*.\f + \fr 10:7 \ft the water: Heb. the face of the water \f* 
\v 8 \w The high places| strong="H1116" \w* \w also of Aven| strong="H206" \w*, \w the sin| strong="H2403" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [shall be destroyed]{strong=“H8045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}: \w the thorn| strong="H6975" \w* \w and the thistle| strong="H1863" \w* [shall come up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w on their altars| strong="H4196" \w*; [and they shall say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to the mountains| strong="H2022" \w*, [Cover]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} [us; and to the hills]{strong=“H1389”}, [Fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} on us. 
\p
\v 9 \w O Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [thou hast sinned]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w from the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*: [there they stood]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: \w the battle| strong="H4421" \w* \w in Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w* \w against the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of iniquity| strong="H5932" \w* [did not overtake]{strong=“H5381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} them. 
\v 10 It is \w in my desire| strong="H185" \w* [that I should chastise]{strong=“H3256” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them; and the people]{strong=“H5971”} [shall be gathered]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} [against them, when they shall bind]{strong=“H631” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w themselves in their two| strong="H8147" \w* \w furrows| strong="H5869" \w*.\f + \fr 10:10 \ft when…: or, when I shall bind them for their two transgressions, or, in their two habitations \f* 
\v 11 \w And Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* is as \w an heifer| strong="H5697" \w* that is [taught]{strong=“H3925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}, and [loveth]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to tread out]{strong=“H1758” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} the corn; [but I passed over]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w upon her fair| strong="H2898" \w* \w neck| strong="H6677" \w*: \w I will make Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [to ride]{strong=“H7392” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}; \w Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [shall plow]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, and \w Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [shall break his clods]{strong=“H7702” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}.\f + \fr 10:11 \ft her…: Heb. the beauty of her neck \f* 
\v 12 [Sow]{strong=“H2232” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w to yourselves in righteousness| strong="H6666" \w*, [reap]{strong=“H7114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w in| strong="H6310" \w* \w mercy| strong="H2617" \w*; [break up]{strong=“H5214” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w your fallow ground| strong="H5215" \w*: for it is \w time| strong="H6256" \w* [to seek]{strong=“H1875” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} the \sc Lord\sc*, [till he come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and rain]{strong=“H3384” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w righteousness| strong="H6664" \w* upon you. 
\v 13 [Ye have plowed]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w wickedness| strong="H7562" \w*, [ye have reaped]{strong=“H7114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w iniquity| strong="H5766" \w*; [ye have eaten]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the fruit| strong="H6529" \w* \w of lies| strong="H3585" \w*: [because thou didst trust]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in thy way| strong="H1870" \w*, \w in the multitude| strong="H7230" \w* \w of thy mighty men| strong="H1368" \w*. 
\v 14 \w Therefore shall a tumult| strong="H7588" \w* [arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w among thy people| strong="H5971" \w*, \w and all thy fortresses| strong="H4013" \w* [shall be spoiled]{strong=“H7703” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”}, \w as Shalman| strong="H8020" \w* \w spoiled| strong="H7701" \w* [Beth-arbel]{strong=“H1009”} \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of battle| strong="H4421" \w*: \w the mother| strong="H517" \w* [was dashed in pieces]{strong=“H7376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} upon her \w children| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 15 \w So| strong="H3602" \w* [shall Beth-el]{strong=“H1008”} [do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto you because| strong="H6440" \w* \w of your great| strong="H7451" \w* \w wickedness| strong="H7451" \w*: \w in a morning| strong="H7837" \w* \w shall the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [utterly]{strong=“H1820” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”} [be cut off]{strong=“H1820” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}.\f + \fr 10:15 \ft your…: Heb. the evil of your evil \f*
\c 11
\p 
\v 1 \w When Israel| strong="H3478" \w* was \w a child| strong="H5288" \w*, [then I loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him, and called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w my son| strong="H1121" \w* \w out of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*. 
\v 2 As [they called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them, so they went]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w from them| strong="H6440" \w*: [they sacrificed]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w unto Baalim| strong="H1168" \w*, [and burned incense]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w to graven images| strong="H6456" \w*. 
\v 3 \w I taught| strong="H8637" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [also to go]{strong=“H8637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8809”}, [taking]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w them by their arms| strong="H2220" \w*; [but they knew]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not that I healed]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them. 
\v 4 [I drew]{strong=“H4900” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them with cords| strong="H2256" \w* \w of a man| strong="H120" \w*, \w with bands| strong="H5688" \w* \w of love| strong="H160" \w*: [and I was to them as they that take off]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w the yoke| strong="H5923" \w* \w on their jaws| strong="H3895" \w*, [and I laid]{strong=“H5186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [meat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} unto them.\f + \fr 11:4 \ft take off: Heb. lift up \f* 
\p
\v 5 [He shall not return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, \w but the Assyrian| strong="H804" \w* \w shall be his king| strong="H4428" \w*, [because they refused]{strong=“H3985” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [to return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\v 6 \w And the sword| strong="H2719" \w* [shall abide]{strong=“H2342” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w on his cities| strong="H5892" \w*, [and shall consume]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w his branches| strong="H905" \w*, [and devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them, \w because of their own counsels| strong="H4156" \w*. 
\v 7 \w And my people| strong="H5971" \w* [are bent]{strong=“H8511” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w to backsliding| strong="H4878" \w* [from me: though they called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them to the most High| strong="H5920" \w*, \w none at all| strong="H3162" \w* [would exalt]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8787”} him.\f + \fr 11:7 \ft none…: Heb. together they exalted not \f* 
\p
\v 8 [How shall I give thee up]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*? how [shall I deliver]{strong=“H4042” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [thee, Israel]{strong=“H3478”}? [how shall I make]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee as Admah| strong="H126" \w*? how [shall I set]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee as Zeboim| strong="H6636" \w*? \w mine heart| strong="H3820" \w* [is turned]{strong=“H2015” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [within me, my repentings]{strong=“H5150”} [are kindled]{strong=“H3648” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w together| strong="H3162" \w*. 
\v 9 [I will not execute]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the fierceness| strong="H2740" \w* \w of mine anger| strong="H639" \w*, [I will not return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to destroy]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*: for I am \w God| strong="H410" \w*, \w and not man| strong="H376" \w*; \w the Holy One| strong="H6918" \w* \w in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of thee: and I will not enter]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the city| strong="H5892" \w*. 
\v 10 [They shall walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w after| strong="H310" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*: [he shall roar]{strong=“H7580” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w like a lion| strong="H738" \w*: [when he shall roar]{strong=“H7580” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w then the children| strong="H1121" \w* [shall tremble]{strong=“H2729” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from the west| strong="H3220" \w*. 
\v 11 [They shall tremble]{strong=“H2729” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w as a bird| strong="H6833" \w* \w out of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, \w and as a dove| strong="H3123" \w* \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Assyria| strong="H804" \w*: [and I will place]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w them in their houses| strong="H1004" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\v 12 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [compasseth]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w me about with lies| strong="H3585" \w*, \w and the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w with deceit| strong="H4820" \w*: \w but Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [yet ruleth]{strong=“H7300” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with God| strong="H410" \w*, [and is faithful]{strong=“H539” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w with the saints| strong="H6918" \w*.\f + \fr 11:12 \ft saints: or, most holy \f*
\c 12
\p 
\v 1 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [feedeth]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w on wind| strong="H7307" \w*, [and followeth]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w after the east wind| strong="H6921" \w*: \w he daily| strong="H3117" \w* [increaseth]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w lies| strong="H3577" \w* \w and desolation| strong="H7701" \w*; [and they do make]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a covenant| strong="H1285" \w* \w with the Assyrians| strong="H804" \w*, \w and oil| strong="H8081" \w* [is carried]{strong=“H2986” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”} \w into Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*. 
\v 2 The \sc Lord\sc* \w hath also a controversy| strong="H7379" \w* \w with Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [and will punish]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* \w according to his ways| strong="H1870" \w*; \w according to his doings| strong="H4611" \w* [will he recompense]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} him.\f + \fr 12:2 \ft punish: Heb. visit upon \f* 
\p
\v 3 \w He took his brother| strong="H251" \w* [by the heel]{strong=“H6117” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the womb| strong="H990" \w*, \w and by his strength| strong="H202" \w* [he had power]{strong=“H8280” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with God| strong="H430" \w*:\f + \fr 12:3 \ft had…: Heb. was a prince, or, behaved himself princely \f* 
\v 4 [Yea, he had power]{strong=“H7786” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w over the angel| strong="H4397" \w*, [and prevailed]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [he wept]{strong=“H1058” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and made supplication]{strong=“H2603” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} [unto him: he found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him in [Beth-el]{strong=“H1008”}, [and there he spake]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} with us; 
\v 5 Even the \sc Lord\sc* \w God| strong="H430" \w* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*; the \sc Lord\sc* is \w his memorial| strong="H2143" \w*. 
\v 6 [Therefore turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thou to thy God| strong="H430" \w*: [keep]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w mercy| strong="H2617" \w* \w and judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, [and wait]{strong=“H6960” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w on thy God| strong="H430" \w* \w continually| strong="H8548" \w*. 
\p
\v 7 He is \w a merchant| strong="H3667" \w*, \w the balances| strong="H3976" \w* \w of deceit| strong="H4820" \w* are \w in his hand| strong="H3027" \w*: [he loveth]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to oppress]{strong=“H6231” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}.\f + \fr 12:7 \ft a merchant: or, Canaan \f* \f + \fr 12:7 \ft oppress: or, deceive \f* 
\v 8 \w And Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Yet I am become rich]{strong=“H6238” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [I have found me out]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w substance| strong="H202" \w*: in \w all my labours| strong="H3018" \w* [they shall find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w none iniquity| strong="H5771" \w* in me that were \w sin| strong="H2399" \w*.\f + \fr 12:8 \ft in all…: or, all my labours suffice me not: he shall have punishment of iniquity in whom is sin \f* \f + \fr 12:8 \ft that: Heb. which \f* 
\v 9 And I that am the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* \w from the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w* [will yet make thee to dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w in tabernacles| strong="H168" \w*, \w as in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of the solemn feast| strong="H4150" \w*. 
\v 10 [I have also spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w by the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*, [and I have multiplied]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w visions| strong="H2377" \w*, [and used similitudes]{strong=“H1819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}, \w by the ministry| strong="H3027" \w* \w of the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*.\f + \fr 12:10 \ft ministry: Heb. hand \f* 
\v 11 Is there \w iniquity| strong="H205" \w* in \w Gilead| strong="H1568" \w*? \w surely they are vanity| strong="H7723" \w*: [they sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w bullocks| strong="H7794" \w* \w in Gilgal| strong="H1537" \w*; [yea, their altars]{strong=“H4196”} are \w as heaps| strong="H1530" \w* \w in the furrows| strong="H8525" \w* \w of the fields| strong="H7704" \w*. 
\v 12 \w And Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [fled]{strong=“H1272” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the country| strong="H7704" \w* \w of Syria| strong="H758" \w*, \w and Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [served]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for a wife| strong="H802" \w*, \w and for a wife| strong="H802" \w* [he kept]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} sheep. 
\v 13 \w And by a prophet| strong="H5030" \w* the \sc Lord\sc* [brought]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w out of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, \w and by a prophet| strong="H5030" \w* [was he preserved]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}. 
\v 14 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* provoked him [to anger]{strong=“H3707” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w most bitterly| strong="H8563" \w*: [therefore shall he leave]{strong=“H5203” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his blood| strong="H1818" \w* [upon him, and his reproach]{strong=“H2781”} \w shall his Lord| strong="H113" \w* [return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} unto him.\f + \fr 12:14 \ft most…: Heb. with bitternesses \f* \f + \fr 12:14 \ft blood: Heb. bloods \f*
\c 13
\p 
\v 1 \w When Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* [spake]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w trembling| strong="H7578" \w*, [he exalted]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w himself in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [but when he offended]{strong=“H816” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in Baal| strong="H1168" \w*, [he died]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 2 [And now they sin]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [more and more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and have made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them molten images| strong="H4541" \w* \w of their silver| strong="H3701" \w*, and \w idols| strong="H6091" \w* \w according to their own understanding| strong="H8394" \w*, \w all of it the work| strong="H4639" \w* \w of the craftsmen| strong="H2796" \w*: [they say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [of them, Let the men]{strong=“H120”} [that sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [kiss]{strong=“H5401” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the calves| strong="H5695" \w*.\f + \fr 13:2 \ft they sin…: Heb. they add to sin \f* \f + \fr 13:2 \ft the men…: or, the sacrificers of men \f* 
\v 3 \w Therefore they shall be as the morning| strong="H1242" \w* \w cloud| strong="H6051" \w*, [and as the early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w dew| strong="H2919" \w* [that passeth away]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w as the chaff| strong="H4671" \w* that [is driven with the whirlwind]{strong=“H5590” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”} \w out of the floor| strong="H1637" \w*, \w and as the smoke| strong="H6227" \w* \w out of the chimney| strong="H699" \w*. 
\v 4 Yet I am the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* \w from the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and thou shalt know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w no god| strong="H430" \w* \w but me| strong="H2108" \w*: for there is [no saviour]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w beside me| strong="H1115" \w*. 
\p
\v 5 [I did know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thee in the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of great drought| strong="H8514" \w*.\f + \fr 13:5 \ft great…: Heb. droughts \f* 
\v 6 \w According to their pasture| strong="H4830" \w*, [so were they filled]{strong=“H7646” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [they were filled]{strong=“H7646” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and their heart| strong="H3820" \w* [was exalted]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [therefore have they forgotten]{strong=“H7911” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} me. 
\v 7 \w Therefore I will be unto them as a lion| strong="H7826" \w*: \w as a leopard| strong="H5246" \w* \w by the way| strong="H1870" \w* [will I observe]{strong=“H7789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} them: 
\v 8 [I will meet]{strong=“H6298” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them as a bear| strong="H1677" \w* that is \w bereaved| strong="H7909" \w* of her whelps, [and will rend]{strong=“H7167” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the caul| strong="H5458" \w* \w of their heart| strong="H3820" \w*, [and there will I devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them like a lion| strong="H3833" \w*: \w the wild| strong="H7704" \w* \w beast| strong="H2416" \w* [shall tear]{strong=“H1234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} them.\f + \fr 13:8 \ft wild…: Heb. beast of the field \f* 
\p
\v 9 \w O Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [thou hast destroyed]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} thyself; but in me is \w thine help| strong="H5828" \w*.\f + \fr 13:9 \ft is…: Heb. in thy help \f* 
\v 10 \w I will| strong="H165" \w* \w be thy king| strong="H4428" \w*: \w where| strong="H645" \w* is any other [that may save]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w thee in all thy cities| strong="H5892" \w*? [and thy judges]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [of whom thou saidst]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w me a king| strong="H4428" \w* \w and princes| strong="H8269" \w*?\f + \fr 13:10 \ft I will…: rather, Where is thy king? \f* 
\v 11 [I gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee a king| strong="H4428" \w* \w in mine anger| strong="H639" \w*, [and took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him \w away in my wrath| strong="H5678" \w*. 
\v 12 \w The iniquity| strong="H5771" \w* \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* is [bound up]{strong=“H6887” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}; \w his sin| strong="H2403" \w* is [hid]{strong=“H6845” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}. 
\v 13 \w The sorrows| strong="H2256" \w* [of a travailing woman]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} upon him: he is \w an unwise| strong="H2450" \w* \w son| strong="H1121" \w*; [for he should not stay]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w long| strong="H6256" \w* in the place of \w the breaking forth| strong="H4866" \w* \w of children| strong="H1121" \w*.\f + \fr 13:13 \ft long: Heb. a time \f* 
\v 14 [I will ransom]{strong=“H6299” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them from the power| strong="H3027" \w* \w of the grave| strong="H7585" \w*; [I will redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them from death| strong="H4194" \w*: \w O death| strong="H4194" \w*, \w I will| strong="H165" \w* \w be thy plagues| strong="H1698" \w*; \w O grave| strong="H7585" \w*, \w I will| strong="H165" \w* \w be thy destruction| strong="H6987" \w*: \w repentance| strong="H5164" \w* [shall be hid]{strong=“H5641” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w from mine eyes| strong="H5869" \w*.\f + \fr 13:14 \ft power: Heb. hand \f* 
\p
\v 15 [Though he be fruitful]{strong=“H6500” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} among his \w brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w an east wind| strong="H6921" \w* [shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w the wind| strong="H7307" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [shall come up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w from the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, \w and his spring| strong="H4726" \w* [shall become dry]{strong=“H954” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and his fountain| strong="H4599" \w* [shall be dried up]{strong=“H2717” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [he shall spoil]{strong=“H8154” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the treasure| strong="H214" \w* \w of all pleasant| strong="H2532" \w* \w vessels| strong="H3627" \w*.\f + \fr 13:15 \ft pleasant…: Heb. vessels of desire \f* 
\v 16 \w Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* [shall become desolate]{strong=“H816” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [for she hath rebelled]{strong=“H4784” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against her God| strong="H430" \w*: [they shall fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w by the sword| strong="H2719" \w*: \w their infants| strong="H5768" \w* [shall be dashed in pieces]{strong=“H7376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”}, \w and their women with child| strong="H2030" \w* [shall be ripped up]{strong=“H1234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”}.
\c 14
\p 
\v 1 \w O Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} unto the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w*; [for thou hast fallen]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w by thine iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*. 
\v 2 [Take]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w with you words| strong="H1697" \w*, [and turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} to the \sc Lord\sc*: [say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [unto him, Take away]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w all iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, [and receive]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} us \w graciously| strong="H2896" \w*: [so will we render]{strong=“H7999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the calves| strong="H6499" \w* \w of our lips| strong="H8193" \w*.\f + \fr 14:2 \ft receive…: or, give good \f* 
\v 3 \w Asshur| strong="H804" \w* [shall not save]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [us; we will not ride]{strong=“H7392” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w upon horses| strong="H5483" \w*: [neither will we say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w any more to the work| strong="H4639" \w* \w of our hands| strong="H3027" \w*, Ye are \w our gods| strong="H430" \w*: \w for in thee the fatherless| strong="H3490" \w* [findeth mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”}. 
\p
\v 4 [I will heal]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their backsliding| strong="H4878" \w*, [I will love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them freely| strong="H5071" \w*: \w for mine anger| strong="H639" \w* [is turned away]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} from him. 
\v 5 \w I will be as the dew| strong="H2919" \w* \w unto Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: [he shall grow]{strong=“H6524” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w as the lily| strong="H7799" \w*, [and cast forth]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w his roots| strong="H8328" \w* \w as Lebanon| strong="H3844" \w*.\f + \fr 14:5 \ft grow: or, blossom \f* \f + \fr 14:5 \ft cast…: Heb. strike \f* 
\v 6 \w His branches| strong="H3127" \w* [shall spread]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and his beauty| strong="H1935" \w* \w shall be as the olive tree| strong="H2132" \w*, \w and his smell| strong="H7381" \w* \w as Lebanon| strong="H3844" \w*.\f + \fr 14:6 \ft spread: Heb. go \f* 
\v 7 [They that dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w under his shadow| strong="H6738" \w* [shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [they shall revive]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} as \w the corn| strong="H1715" \w*, [and grow]{strong=“H6524” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w as the vine| strong="H1612" \w*: \w the scent| strong="H2143" \w* thereof shall be \w as the wine| strong="H3196" \w* \w of Lebanon| strong="H3844" \w*.\f + \fr 14:7 \ft grow: or, blossom \f* \f + \fr 14:7 \ft scent: or, memorial \f* 
\p
\v 8 \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* shall say, \w What have I to do any more with idols| strong="H6091" \w*? [I have heard]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} him, [and observed]{strong=“H7789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him: I am \w like a green| strong="H7488" \w* \w fir tree| strong="H1265" \w*. \w From me is thy fruit| strong="H6529" \w* [found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}. 
\v 9 Who is \w wise| strong="H2450" \w*, [and he shall understand]{strong=“H995” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} these things? [prudent]{strong=“H995” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [and he shall know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them? for the ways]{strong=“H1870”} of the \sc Lord\sc* are \w right| strong="H3477" \w*, \w and the just| strong="H6662" \w* [shall walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [in them: but the transgressors]{strong=“H6586” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall fall]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} therein. 